@CapsMedial=[A Aacute Abreve Abreveacute Abrevedotbelow Abrevegrave Abrevehookabove Abrevetilde Acircumflex Acircumflexacute Acircumflexdotbelow Acircumflexgrave Acircumflexhookabove Acircumflextilde Adieresis Adotbelow Agrave Ahookabove Aring Atilde G Gbreve H J K L Ldot M Q R U Uacute Ucircumflex Udieresis Udotbelow Ugrave Uhookabove Uhorn Uhornacute Uhorndotbelow Uhorngrave Uhornhookabove Uhorntilde Utilde X Y Yacute Ydotbelow Ygrave Yhookabove Ytilde Z];
